      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xujiahui",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Xujiahui Cathedral, seen in Spielberg's 1987 film Empire of the Sun, marks the area's religious heritage.",
